    GetStdHandle
    WriteFile
    ReadFile
    CreateFileW
    CloseHandle
    ExitProcess
    GetLastError
    SetLastError
    VirtualAlloc
    VirtualFree
    VirtualProtect
    GetProcAddress
    LoadLibraryW
    LoadLibraryA
    HeapAlloc
    HeapFree
    GetProcessHeap
    HeapReAlloc
